#: ../../source/unit/encoder4_motor_driver.rst:8
msgid ""
"This library controls Unit 4EncoderMotor Driver over I2C, including four "
"motor channels, open-loop PWM, position and speed control, and encoder "
"feedback."
msgstr "本库通过 I2C 控制 Unit 4EncoderMotor Driver，支持四路电机的开环 PWM 控制、位置控制、速度控制以及编码器反馈。"

