#: of unit.encoder4_motor_driver.Encoder4MotorDriverUnit:1
msgid "Control the Unit 4EncoderMotor Driver over I2C."
msgstr "通过 I2C 控制 Unit 4EncoderMotor Driver。"

#: of unit.encoder4_motor_driver.Encoder4MotorDriverUnit:3
msgid ""
"The Unit supports four motor channels with open-loop PWM, position and "
"speed control, encoder feedback, soft start and stop, RGB LED control, "
"and input power monitoring. The object borrows the supplied I2C bus and "
"does not deinitialize it. If the configured address is not found, check "
"the Unit's Grove connection, power supply, and I2C address."
msgstr ""
"Unit 支持四路电机的开环 PWM 控制、位置控制、速度控制、编码器反馈、软启动和软停止、RGB LED "
"控制及输入电压和电流监测。驱动使用传入的 I2C 总线，不会关闭该总线。未检测到指定地址时，请检查 Unit 的 Grove 接线、供电和 I2C"
" 地址。"

