#: of unit.encoder4_motor_driver.Encoder4MotorDriverUnit:26
msgid "Motor channel constants:"
msgstr "电机通道常量："

#: of unit.encoder4_motor_driver.Encoder4MotorDriverUnit:28
msgid "``MOTOR_ALL = -1``: apply a setter or action to all four motors in order."
msgstr "``MOTOR_ALL = -1``：依次对全部四路电机执行设置或控制操作。"

#: of unit.encoder4_motor_driver.Encoder4MotorDriverUnit:29
msgid ""
"``MOTOR_1 = 0``, ``MOTOR_2 = 1``, ``MOTOR_3 = 2``, ``MOTOR_4 = 3``: "
"select one motor. Reading methods accept one channel in the range 0~3."
msgstr ""
"``MOTOR_1 = 0``、``MOTOR_2 = 1``、``MOTOR_3 = 2``、``MOTOR_4 = "
"3``：选择对应的一路电机。读取数据时需指定单个通道，通道编号为 0~3。"

#: of unit.encoder4_motor_driver.Encoder4MotorDriverUnit:32
msgid "Control mode constants:"
msgstr "电机控制模式常量："

#: of unit.encoder4_motor_driver.Encoder4MotorDriverUnit:34
msgid "``MODE_OPEN_LOOP = 0``: open-loop PWM control."
msgstr "``MODE_OPEN_LOOP = 0``：开环 PWM 控制。"

#: of unit.encoder4_motor_driver.Encoder4MotorDriverUnit:35
msgid "``MODE_POSITION = 1``: position control."
msgstr "``MODE_POSITION = 1``：位置控制。"

#: of unit.encoder4_motor_driver.Encoder4MotorDriverUnit:36
msgid "``MODE_SPEED = 2``: speed control."
msgstr "``MODE_SPEED = 2``：速度控制。"

#: of unit.encoder4_motor_driver.Encoder4MotorDriverUnit:38
msgid "Encoder phase constants:"
msgstr "编码器相位常量："

#: of unit.encoder4_motor_driver.Encoder4MotorDriverUnit:40
msgid "``ENCODER_MODE_AB = 0``: AB phase order."
msgstr "``ENCODER_MODE_AB = 0``：AB 相位顺序。"

#: of unit.encoder4_motor_driver.Encoder4MotorDriverUnit:41
msgid "``ENCODER_MODE_BA = 1``: BA phase order."
msgstr "``ENCODER_MODE_BA = 1``：BA 相位顺序。"

#: of unit.encoder4_motor_driver.Encoder4MotorDriverUnit:43
msgid ""
"Speed samples and closed-loop speed targets use the device's native "
"values in the range -127~127, without a documented RPM conversion. "
"Position speed limits use the native range 0~127. Soft start and stop "
"gradually changes PWM output to reduce mechanical shock when starting, "
"stopping, or changing speed."
msgstr ""
"速度读数和闭环速度设置值的范围均为 -127~127，协议未提供其与转速（RPM）的换算关系。位置控制的速度上限范围为 "
"0~127。启用软启动和软停止后，PWM 输出会逐渐变化，减轻电机启动、停止或调速时的机械冲击。"

#: of unit.encoder4_motor_driver.Encoder4MotorDriverUnit.set_motor_mode:1
msgid "Set one motor control mode."
msgstr "设置一路电机的控制模式。"

