#: of unit.encoder4_motor_driver.Encoder4MotorDriverUnit.set_i2c_address:1
msgid "Set the Unit I2C address and switch this object to it."
msgstr "修改 Unit 的 I2C 地址，并更新当前驱动对象使用的地址。"

#: of unit.encoder4_motor_driver.Encoder4MotorDriverUnit.set_i2c_address:3
msgid ""
"A changed address is retained in the Unit's flash and immediately "
"restarts the Unit. The call waits at least 300 ms, then polls the new "
"address before updating this object. Avoid unnecessary calls to limit "
"flash writes."
msgstr ""
"新地址会保存到 Unit 的 Flash 中，并立即触发 Unit 重启。本方法会先等待至少 300 "
"ms，再检测新地址，确认响应后更新驱动对象的地址。请避免不必要的调用，以减少 Flash 写入次数。"

#: of unit.encoder4_motor_driver.Encoder4MotorDriverUnit.set_i2c_address:8
msgid "New 7-bit I2C address. Range: 0x08~0x77."
msgstr "新的 7 位 I2C 地址，范围为 0x08~0x77。"

